litterbox-qt (0.1-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Qt inbox manual card creation and `=` drag reorder (R38): the add-card
    control opens a rendered dialog and creates an open manual card, and the
    `=` handle grabs and drags a card to its landing row, keeping pinned cards
    inside the pinned block and refusing a card anchored to its time. The
    app-native capture proves the open dialog, real pointer drags up and down,
    a no-motion press that changes nothing, and the neighbouring Note and Done
    controls, along with the local cache and queued operations.

 -- Litterbox <litterbox@example.com>  Wed, 30 Sep 2026 12:10:00 +0400

